# title-survival — the title Survival difficulty selector (the code-6 overlay
# FUN_0049c644 @ 0x49cbe8; NOT a submenu_state — it slides in OVER the still-
# visible main menu) on a CRAFTED save that unlocks the Survival menu row.
#
# Unlock: FUN_0049a324 returns uVar1 == 3 only when a save bank has GAME_MODE
# (bank dword 0xb759) == 3 AND an item-table entry with (id>>6) in [0xd49..0xd50]
# (an "adventure-8" item).  tools/craft_survival_save.py pokes both onto bank 1
# of the guild save + restamps the bank checksum (else save_bank_init_all resets
# the tampered bank on load).  embedded save: 83966ab684330c1e9eea184bb0aed31e36cf19bef2862a00efc7492b49fc55b5
#
# With Survival unlocked the menu is [CONT_HAS_SAVE, NEW_HAS_SAVE, SURVIVAL(2),
# CONTINUE_ANY(3=default cursor), RANKING, HIDDEN_CHAR, OPTIONS, EXIT], so UP×1
# from the default cursor lands on SURVIVAL; A opens the selector.  It slides in
# (survival_state 1→8) and pins at 8 — TITLE_SURVIVAL_READY fires there (a
# +0-stretch join, no async load at the title, like the picker/records anchors).
# Mid-capture a DOWN (anchor+40) toggles the option Hell→Normal, so the window
# verifies BOTH highlighted rows + the hand-cursor ease to the Normal row.
